<title>INDIA: CRICKET-INDIA SCORE 289-6 IN 50 OVERS AGAINST AUSTRALIA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-INDIA SCORE 289-6 IN 50 OVERS AGAINST AUSTRALIA.</headline>
<dateline>MOHALI, India 1996-11-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>India scored 289 for six in</p>
<p>50 overs after being put in to bat by Australian skipper Mark</p>
<p>Taylor in the last preliminary league match of the Titan Cup</p>
<p>triangular limited-over series on Sunday.</p>
</text>
